": "ss2.png", "id": "421888538948247", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982542_421888542281580_7961047171456036679_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zUDP4U-D_mIQ7kNvwGeHRyi&_nc_oc=Ado3fPxhG9Xa8rhWEH9DrxBRSXvSqMo0R9xVyTMel9EBYM98uujF6o3xItA-oiRePkQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRDfFk7rizwCyGyZrEOIyZOK1Pk1FfHXEJCvneaPcpXjg&oe=6B0C5EE2"}, {"file_name": "ss1.png", "id": "900672037137096", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569452_900672040470429_3602208668542724751_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y-huVFh7TD0Q7kNvwHholt_&_nc_oc=AdogyjCspkDFW8i1ldARLYUSupzpSefA1_BdrBBeyqI3xb5aloZDOHhSRYfn4vwBY30&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ6ejv-O-zq_28uN_EwAlIKg5ZlDpsh1SVBhOvmkyJrig&oe=6B0C7E76"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "215595850179052", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036702_215595853512385_1516722769013058759_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Yc0JfCd_C8kQ7kNvwG-P0Li&_nc_oc=AdobmkWyfD10WhsaQG7MbBxbXXzFtqD8ECeeHA0PhQ3gXRrzf8gAuM6k62vbOGbMpT4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSEj6ufwGGrJ4oFjoReAWrFUq7DjuujYiHdw0I0RKlTXg&oe=6B0C4DA4"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "416146802772950", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982521_416146806106283_7161111592696257607_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IaBMi9YK5MIQ7kNvwHM33kD&_nc_oc=AdqIZBVQUNRuNzZZHvfcqFz76lIZsVhk4NAeTROXz24hRTLwss2j9fA8SulSXV2W1wI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQHjebbokolX8TF4CoYRVOgR5wvO9Nmh5ndKr-2zs664w&oe=6B0C6B50"}, {"file_name": "ss7.png", "id": "512472986379303", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_512472989712636_7638735751378089066_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qMIdQFxfSrkQ7kNvwGaZzOT&_nc_oc=AdrDveofw6o40eDmA2U1YW-EyvAXpQ3qeTWij_28nJq7UWIfwG3LpMWoEFjUkhAbP4Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT6yJj1THf_VKE6lduqtv3p1h88bqzSHdQS_q_8XiwjdA&oe=6B0C65E1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Counter Fight ICHIRAN", "keywords": ["ICHIRAN", "CounterFight", "JobSimulator", "Ramen", "cooking"], "long_description": "Make some mouth-watering ramen!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game created with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan. Established over 60 years ago, it's been perfecting its hit specialty tonkotsu ramen for a long time, which is why ICHIRAN's ramen is the best in the land. In fact, it's often touted in the media as a \"must-try cuisine\" for foreign visitors.\n\nGame Features:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score! \nImmersive kitchen-based gameplay lets you experience life as a real ICHIRAN employee, racking up points for your ramen preparation skills and speedy delivery.\n\n\u30fbClimb the ranks in store management mode! \nYour score in store management mode is entered into a world ranking. Boost your profits to employ more staff and increase seating capacity as you try to hit the high scores with your own unique store!\n\n*In-game kitchen layout may differ from actual restaurants.", "short_description": "Cook some knockout noodles!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game made with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous organic tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan, often touted as a \"must-try cuisine\" for tourists. It has outlets in NY, Hong Kong, and Taiwan, too.\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score!\n\u30fbTake top place in store management mode!\n\u30fbBoost profits, employ more staff, up capacity, and hit the high scores with your own unique store!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "MiniLandscape.png", "id": "3838591046231584", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984462_3838591052898250_5002299579482394963_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RKCwsvT_z6AQ7kNvwGxVWRq&_nc_oc=AdrKYitoB6ws4tBx4tNxRF33FMcmYyhzKwDqtXh69qf36rbpPqGEIL_ulHhqlhVfv4E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSmG4Qg65sXpcmSF68JiSQIlyJkEKdIVh9ErO3jxe--0w&oe=6B0C509E"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "2182671695203710", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_2182671698537043_1819436220465957851_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V0qw5jSasKEQ7kNvwERAhcg&_nc_oc=AdqvW4Kv_QLxmwIh8tL00q9ZglVwqBy-M0q2-z9IppqrIXH0LjpD7fMaiwwwG-f63rk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSzdgeNWLeUC9h3DMFc9yFB1E8MYNIswiqoLIwVrc-Afw&oe=6B0C663B"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "446502446404480", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476755_446502449737813_695504826495623275_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DfzTz1rjj7AQ7kNvwEYMj7g&_nc_oc=Adocw6gcf_liSNGf0MJ562Jk7qKjajLrghTLseJ4olsWDRkygbjgfRhU2zIuGiOPyeU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQREbzJWUBXqmEN-mI9h1pxSrcc_WFR4qShEVzquTsdjCA&oe=6B0C5261"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "442920633578734", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240108_442920636912067_8939691330164956004_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_sGWcNQ-iEwQ7kNvwEr78OR&_nc_oc=AdqLC9dqxKv0vQdkqJcICdss4SrUJATCtKXaBaggCzJrTn1WC4yc-XC3H8uSlpm8mZA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTu1BRPHBZK5DaDzz_tcwOPPuHLjrbCuE8Z